_package: ENERGINET.entities.Measurement
_type: Entity
_name: Measurement
label: Measurement
pluralLabel: Measurements
entityType: BASIC
physicalTableName: MEASUREMENT
iconUrl: images://mdi/chart-line.svg
description: |-
  Aggregated value window (average, minimum, maximum, quality) of a measurement point, loaded from the operational historian.

  AI agent instructions: These are aggregates, not raw samples: never sum averages across windows; weight by window length. Read the unit from the measurement point.
documentation: |-
  Aggregated value window (average, minimum, maximum, quality) of a measurement point, loaded from the operational historian.

  AI agent instructions: These are aggregates, not raw samples: never sum averages across windows; weight by window length. Read the unit from the measurement point.
historizeGolden: false
historizeMaster: false
enableDelete: true
attributes:
